2026 Core Modernization, Bug Fixes & Extensions — Raja Zahidi:
  - Core Codebase Repairs:
    * Fixed null pointer crashes in TrackDialog and channel/patch switching
    * Fixed audio setting dialog null dereference and PCM device feedback
    * Modernized CI build for Ubuntu 22.04, GCC 11, and wxWidgets 3.0
    * Generated and fixed missing startup HTML help system
    * Fixed Piano Roll UI interactions, scrolling, and note name displays
    * Fixed dialog layout, sizing collapse bugs, and menu organization
  - New Audio & MIDI Features:
    * MIDI Effects Suite (Arpeggiator, Humanizer, Harmonizer, MIDI Echo)
    * Procedural Sound FX & 808 Analog Drum Synthesizer
    * Audio DSP Engine (3-Band EQ, Reverb, Delay, Chorus, Limiter/Overdrive)
    * Overhauled and enlarged Guitar Board & Tablature editor (1040x280) with
      tuning indicators, fret markers, pearl inlays, and real-time audio preview
    * Automated cross-platform CI for Linux (AppImage) and Windows x64 (ZIP)
    * Comprehensive automated unit test suite via CTest (210 tests)

